MOD 1A - INCORPORATION OF REVISED DELAYED NEUTRON DATA            9246 1451   25
                W. B. WILSON [2-28-05]                            9246 1451   26
                                                                  9246 1451   27
New DN 6-gp parameters from CINDER'90 summation calculations are  9246 1451   28
available.  The CINDER calculations are based on a new CINDER     9246 1451   29
library in which beta-decay half-lives and beta-delayed neutron-  9246 1451   30
emission probablities are obtained from the evaluated experimental9246 1451   31
data file NuBase2003 (G. Audi, O. Bersillon, J. Blanchot, and     9246 1451   32
A. H. Wapstra, Nuclear Physics A729 (2003) p. 3-129), when avail- 9246 1451   33
able there. When experimental data are not available there they   9246 1451   34
are calculated in a model where allowed Gamow-Teller decays are   9246 1451   35
treated in a microscopic quasi-particle random-phase approximation9246 1451   36
(QRPA) and the first forbidden decays are treated in the statis-  9246 1451   37
tical gross theory (P. Moller, B. Pfeiffer, and K.-L. Kratz, Phys.9246 1451   38
Rev. C. 67 (2003) 055802). Further refinements are anticipated    9246 1451   39
before the final release of ENDF-7.                               9246 1451   40
